Output ../replay.gif
Output ../replay.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 4ms

Hide
Type "cd /workspace"
Enter
Show

Type "python3 labs/02-sleeper-memory/media/show.py replay"
Enter
Sleep 12s
